*> EXEC SQL WHENEVER ... GO TO and PERFORM make their procedures
*> reachable: the precompiler calls them after later SQL statements.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. WHENEVER.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    EXEC SQL WHENEVER SQLERROR GO TO DB-ERROR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL WHENEVER NOT FOUND PERFORM NO-ROWS END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL DELETE FROM ORDERS END-EXEC
    STOP RUN.
NO-ROWS.
    DISPLAY "NOTHING TO DELETE".
DB-ERROR.
    DISPLAY "DATABASE ERROR"
    STOP RUN.
